# Database (Cursor adapter)

1. Read `packages/database/AGENTS.md` (and root `AGENTS.md` / `SECURITY.md`).
2. Migrations and schema changes are R2; production/destructive ops are R3 — prepare only until Chief authorizes.
3. Never print or commit `DATABASE_URL`; never bypass the reset guard.
4. Prefer `pnpm db:generate`, `pnpm db:migrate`, `pnpm db:seed`, `pnpm --filter @safrs/database test`.
5. `pnpm db:reset` is local-only and requires explicit reset authorization.
